== Equipment ==
'''Weapons''':
* [[gww:Swift|Swift]] "''[[gww:Inscription#Spell enhancing|Don't Think Twice]]''" (envoy) staff [[gww:Of the (Profession)|of the necromancer]] as your main casting weapon.
* [[gww:Swift|Swift]] "''[[gww:Inscription#Spell enhancing|Don't Think Twice]]''" (envoy) staff [[gww:Of Enchanting|of enchanting]] for enchantments.
* [[gww:Caster weapon#High energy set|High energy set]]. Use when extra energy is needed.
* Shield set: "''[[gww:Inscription#Spell enhancing|Let the Memory Live Again]]''" spear of [[gww:Of Defense|defense]] with a shield of [[gww:Of Fortitude|fortitude]].

'''Armor'''
* 5 [[gww:Blessed Insignia|blessed insignias]].
* Rune of [[gww:Rune of Vigor|superior vigor]].
* 2 runes of [[gww:Rune of Vitae|vitae]].
== Usage ==
*<pvxbig>Shadow step to priority target with [[shadow theft@16].
* Cast [[deadly haste@20] and place an [[ebon battle standard of honor@10].
* Wear down low-armour targets with [[dancing daggers@20] followed by either [[crippling dagger@20] for the most damage or [[disrupting dagger@20] for shutdown.
* Apply deep wound condition with [[augury of death@20] against groups with healers.
* Use [[channeling@8] if a fight might get long-drawn.</pvxbig>
== Notes ==
*<pvxbig>A trigger of [[augury of death@20] will interrupt your current action and dismiss any active aftercast delay.<!-- need to check whether it clears knock down, too, like Avatars ending-->
*The recharge time of your half-range spells under the effect of [[deadly haste@20] is...
**{{skill pvxicon|Dancing Daggers|20}} 1 second.
**{{skill pvxicon|Crippling Dagger|20}} 1 second.
**{{skill pvxicon|Disrupting Dagger|20}} 2 seconds.
**{{skill pvxicon|Augury of Death|20}} 4 seconds.
*[[Dancing daggers@20], creating three daggers, triggers [[ebon battle standard of honor@10] thrice per cast.
*Damage under [[shadow theft@20] and [[ebon battle standard of honor@10] against 60 armour rating:
**{{skill pvxicon|Dancing Daggers|20}} – 180 (60×3)
**{{skill pvxicon|Crippling Dagger|20}} – 90
**{{skill pvxicon|Disrupting Dagger|20}} – 58
*Against 100 armour rating:
**{{skill pvxicon|Dancing Daggers|20}} – 114 (38×3)
**{{skill pvxicon|Crippling Dagger|20}} – 53
**{{skill pvxicon|Disrupting Dagger|20}} – 37</pvxbig>
== Synergies and Counters ==
<pvxbig>;Performs well with/against:
*With external energy support via [[blood is power] (required).
*With additional external energy support like [[energizing finale], [[well of power], [[energy boon].
*With additional sources of [[ebon battle standard of honor@10] for better area coverage.
*With cracked armour.
*With [[frustration], triggered via [[disrupting dagger@20].
*Against single targets.
*Against low armour ratings.
;Performs poorly with/against:
* Against groups of foes.
* Against high armour ratings against elemental damage.
* Against small prots (flat damage reduction like [[shielding hands], [[shield of absorption], [[union]).
* Against frequent enchantment removal.
* Against general anti-caster.</pvxbig>
